"method can plot 3-D surfaces with surftype=&quot;surface&quot;. Here, we "
"supply the data as an xarray.DataArray with the coordinate vectors x and y "
"defined. Note that the perspective parameter here controls the azimuth and "
"elevation angle of the view. Specifying the same scale for the projection "
